UX-writing rewrite dataset — third-party attribution
=====================================================

A subset of the training data consists of curated keep-examples (interface strings
kept verbatim as "already-clear" exemplars) harvested from the English localization
bundles of permissively-licensed open-source products. Each such row records its
source repository, license, file URL, and pinned commit in its `provenance` object
(example_type = "oss_microcopy_keep"). Only MIT/Apache-2.0 sources are used; copyleft
(e.g. CC-BY-SA) and unclear/mixed-license sources are excluded.

